{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-05-10 06:30:00', 'title': 'INCREASE EFFICIENCY WITH VERSATILE TRIMBLE GUIDEX GUIDANCE SYSTEM FOR VIRTUALLY ANY MACHINE TYPE', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF., MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ:TRMB) INTRODUCED TODAY THE TRIMBLE® GUIDEX MACHINE GUIDANCE SYSTEM, AN ADVANCED MACHINE NAVIGATION SOLUTION INTENDED TO QUICKLY AND EFFICIENTLY GUIDE MACHINES ALONG ROUTE CORRIDORS OR TO SPECIFIC TARGET AREAS, WHILE PROVIDING LOCAL AWARENESS USING CUSTOMER PROVIDED MAPPING OR ENGINEERING DATA TO CREATE EXCLUSION AND INCLUSION ZONES.'}